{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_001_07_i",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:b19ab8d3da300ebacee47b3a61898377c939a862df73c671d6366b594aa904b0",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_i:cmd-000017:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:146c5bec34d5e7758cc88fc1cd0a4c522254c57184f739f36e006c4deaee18c4",
      "text": "闭店后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_i:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd290a90c57653beba1efc1a0c1acb92d6d8a195132afb892b570976239b4987",
      "text": "今天真是太感谢了！\n活动大获成功！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_i:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33f89945faf134b88f42dda80ee4b55bf73fd7ef06ad76c2fc60e27171769659",
      "text": "……我们这边才是，今天获得了很棒的经验。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_i:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c3b55317f5e838dd2fdfb1ded3992bd4339e4e0fd975c64fe0f7f148365310d8",
      "text": "为了不辜负大家的期待，我们会更加努力。\n所以……今后也请多多支持我们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_i:cmd-000070:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d71121103c432c267f823ff67d75c9f1185775691108669e1c31bec21dbccadc",
      "text": "当天的回家路上……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_i:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac54338bc022cee712de31c64ada3d036c75ef2f66eba3a16561e8eec3418d4b",
      "text": "不仅让很多人认识了我们，\n还把笑容带给了每一位前来的客人……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_i:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e52a92b0092abed44371beecd0b8fd914adb92f04b804b39111a652928bee10",
      "text": "总觉得又让世界多了一份和平呢。\n大家的努力没有白费。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_i:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4843ab51a07c0f8b5f7d7b27180c19bc6422453f2e511c991f8680daec98af35",
      "text": "是啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_i:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77f2aa6743b2d74761dfe9001abce0fc01d53b674ef3f4de7e25b20708269a5d",
      "text": "（虽然可能只是迈出了一小步。但是……\n现在的我，正在用自己的力量开辟道路）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_i:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0f014c07d418333d1b609b656cb4cb22845aa9b5129390299bab5df4d331565",
      "text": "（就这样作为偶像继续成长下去……\n由我们三个人，去抓住梦想！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_i:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8433a32a17a14313b5f8d99a1168e8c0bca4f180a0c73d17484ea31317d17c96",
      "text": "皮埃尔从刚才开始就一直很安静，\n没事……啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_i:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5b7e46f387d09d9688c3c64ac93a534d82a272876bda7a995563c1b9f56bb59",
      "text": "嗯……唔唔……\n大家，笑容。好开心……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_i:cmd-000142:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c3e11043db00e3b8a6cfa3f7aea89bec399803141388581290753e202a7e637a",
      "text": "……睡得真香啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_i:cmd-000147:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb9acbb2b1d4285ae8109e731884665c4edd37c4ced977fd1757eabfeddb4f7b",
      "text": "皮埃尔也很努力了嘛。\n就让他这么睡吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_i:cmd-000188:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8e7479eb058cf1e3e5ab05586dd6220e8d885d667717611e3b6e0954c993b58",
      "text": "请、请问……我是实的粉丝！\n今后也会一直支持您的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_i:cmd-000207:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7954b76c4b81338c2960c8cd609d2faccbe458f3ae394f27db8914f460252957",
      "text": "（叔叔、以及许许多多的人\n为之着迷的“偶像”……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_i:cmd-000211:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1833584b52539da0264f42c773003580e15fdcadfdbd236f791333214ddd9745",
      "text": "（我自己，是否也稍微接近了一点\n那样的存在呢……）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
